This is an independent OpenPencil integration, not an OpenAI-authored plugin.

The native Codex UI uses the original OpenPencil Rust/WASM runtime and its compiled JavaScript glue from https://github.com/ex3lite/openpencil (upstream ZSeven-W/openpencil), MIT. CanvasKit stays in the separately installed runtime with its own license. native-engine.js is generated by scripts/build-native-editor.mjs; it is not a replacement renderer.
